      ]
    },
    { "cuadros": [] },
    { "cuadros": [] },
    { "cuadros": [] }
  ]
}
```

**Hypothesis:**  
If a cannon is placed onto a column that already contains a pirate (and the column has no cannon yet), the cannon fires in the same round’s shoot phase. Consequently, a newly‑placed cannon can deal damage to that pirate immediately, giving the player an extra shot on the pirate compared to waiting for the next round.

