      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

Hypothesis: When a new cannon is placed onto a column that already contains a cannon, the merge happens during the action phase and the resulting cannon fires in the same round with its updated (summed) damage. This means the increased damage is applied immediately, not starting only the next round.

